OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FA jury has heard how a teenage boy
OL,8,Ffilmed himself fatally stabbing a
OL,9,Fschoolboy in a "ruthless and
OL,10,Fremorseless" attack.
OL,12,FShayne Hambakachere, who was 16, was
OL,13,Ffound seriously injured in Chippenham
OL,14,Fon January 31.
OL,16,FHe was taken to Southmead Hospital in
OL,17,FBristol but died from a single stab
OL,18,Fwound, which had penetrated his heart.
OL,26,@qD@POUrD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
