PN,40502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FA 16-year-old boy, who cannot be
OL,8,Fidentified because of his age, denies
OL,9,Fmurder and is on trial at Bristol
OL,10,FCrown Court.
OL,12,FProsecuting, Sarah Jones KC opened the
OL,13,Fcase against the defendant to the jury
OL,14,Fof eight men and four women on Tuesday.
OL,16,FShe described how there was "tension"
OL,17,Fbetween Shayne and the boy, who
OL,18,Farranged to meet in an alleyway.
OL,26,@xD@]OUxD@eO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,F"(The defendant) videoed himself
OL,8,Fbefore the meeting, posing with a
OL,9,Fknife ` the actual knife that was used
OL,10,Fin the stabbing," Ms Jones said.
OL,12,F"He slices it through the air in front
OL,13,Fof the camera and boasts 'bare sharp `
OL,14,FI'm going to be slicing'.
OL,16,F"There is such gleeful anticipation,
OL,17,Fsuch swagger as he poses."
OL,19,FThe court heard the defendant then
OL,20,Ffilmed himself meeting Shayne and
OL,21,Fstabbing him moments later.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@BpmoD@PpnrD@QO]tD@AOUxD@AOUyD@
OL,26,AZO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
