PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FMs Jones warned jurors that the video
OL,8,Fwas "distressing" and "shocking" to
OL,9,Fwatch because of the speed of the
OL,10,Fstabbing.
OL,12,FFootage played to the court begins
OL,13,Fwith the camera pointing at the
OL,14,Fdefendant's shoes as he waits for
OL,15,FShayne.
OL,17,F"As Shayne appears, evidently unarmed
OL,18,Fand alone, the onslaught from (the
OL,19,Fdefendant) is immediate," Ms Jones
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,26,@pD@EOUpD@QO]pD@WOUpD@`O]yD@AOUzD@_pm{D@
OL,26,AJpn{D@YO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
