PN,40505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,F"He brandishes the knife ` the one he
OL,8,Fwas posing with earlier.
OL,10,F"Shayne appears stunned. He tries to
OL,11,Fgrab hold of (the defendant's) arm
OL,12,Fwhich is holding the knife, but
OL,13,Fquickly recoils and then speedily
OL,14,Fbacks away with both hands held up,
OL,15,Fpalms facing (the defendant).
OL,17,F"(The defendant) jabs forcefully with
OL,18,Fthe knife, moving forward towards
OL,19,FShayne, and the blade makes contact,
OL,20,Fwith a noise as it hits him in the
OL,21,Fmiddle of the chest.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@AOUsD@NpmsD@^pnwD@NpmwD@\pnyD@
OL,26,AAOUyD@BpmyD@Ppn
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
