PN,40506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,F"Shayne brings his hands to his chest,
OL,8,Fexclaiming in pain, as he turns and
OL,9,Fruns off."
OL,11,FShayne, a year 11 schoolboy at
OL,12,FHardenhuish School in Chippenham, ran
OL,13,Fto a nearby road where he collapsed on
OL,14,Fthe pavement.
OL,16,FEmergency services attended, and
OL,17,FShayne told a police officer that the
OL,18,Fdefendant had stabbed him. He was
OL,19,Fpronounced dead at 9.37pm the
OL,20,Ffollowing day.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@JO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FJurors were told that the defendant
OL,8,Finitially denied any involvement in
OL,9,FShayne's death but was now claiming he
OL,10,Facted in self defence.
OL,12,FMs Jones said: "The most senseless
OL,13,Fdestruction of two young lives ` the
OL,14,Fending of Shane's life and the removal
OL,15,Fof (the defendant's) immediate future
OL,16,Fprospects.
OL,26,@tD@POUwD@DpmwD@Tpn
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,F"But it could not be clearer that (the
OL,8,Fdefendant) was not acting in self
OL,9,Fdefence ` he was on the attack and he
OL,10,Facted with ruthless and remorseless
OL,11,Fdetermination."
OL,13,FThe court heard it was not clear why
OL,14,FShayne and the defendant had fallen
OL,15,Fout.
OL,17,FOn January 19, Shayne said he had been
OL,18,Frobbed of cannabis and a knife by the
OL,19,Fdefendant ` who later sent a
OL,20,Fphotograph of himself smoking what
OL,21,Fappears to be cannabis.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@cpmpD@JpnsD@OO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FMs Jones told jurors that on the day
OL,8,Fof the killing, Shayne sent the
OL,9,Fdefendant a message to arrange for
OL,10,Fthem to "sort all of this out with
OL,11,Ffists" and went to his home address.
OL,13,FThe defendant later told Shayne to
OL,14,Fmeet him in an alleyway in Chippenham.
OL,16,FAfter the stabbing, the defendant is
OL,17,Falleged to have run to a derelict
OL,18,Fbuilding and discarded the knife.
OL,26,@rD@IOUsD@FO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786553276
OL,3,CSchoolboy was fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Cattack filmed on mobile phone, jury
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FPolice recovered the weapon, with
OL,8,Fblood on the blade matching Shayne's
OL,9,Fand DNA on the handle matching the
OL,10,Fdefendant's, the court heard.
OL,12,FA post-mortem examination found Shayne
OL,13,Fhad died from a single stab wound to
OL,14,Fthe left side of his chest, which
OL,15,Fpassed through the chest wall and into
OL,16,Fhis heart.
OL,18,FThe defendant denies murder and his
OL,19,Ftrial, expected to last for two weeks,
OL,20,Fcontinues.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/10
